# VT52TST - Exercise the VT52 personality

```text
VT52TST
```

## Identification

Activate VT52.RSX, then run VT52TST. It asks the personality to identify
itself. A successful reply permits the visual tests to proceed.

## Inspect pages

Check the position marker and tab stop. At the right edge A and C should
occupy the last two columns on the marked row. On the erase page, KEEP
should remain on both lines. Press a key at each prompt. See
[RSX](RSX.HLP) for personality selection.
